ument or any ancestor of the target has `scrollTop > 0`\n  - the target is inside `dialog[open]`, `[role=dialog|alertdialog]`,\n    `[aria-modal=true]` or any `position: fixed` element (this covers\n    `PopupContentModal`, the mobile nav overlays and the FAB)\n  - an ancestor has a `touch-action` that excludes vertical panning (e.g. maps)\n\n  If a page handler calls `preventDefault()` on `touchmove`, as\n  svelte-dnd-action does once a drag starts, the script also reports blocked\n  mid-gesture. If a page has no script (still loading, or an error page), the\n# Verdict: Swipe from top to reload\n\nid: object\nreviewer:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @reviewer and/or @security after implementation. -->\n\n## Review\n\n<!-- TASK-1: PASS / FAIL / PARTIAL\n     notes: ...\n\nTASK-2: ...\n-->\n\n## Security\n\n<!-- Any security findings from @security, or \"none\" if not run. -->\n\n## Overall\n\n<!-- APPROVED / REJECTED / NEEDS WORK -->\n<!-- Summary of what needs to change before this can be approved, if anything. -->\nls: cannot access '/workspace/.manigot': No such file or directory\n4b737a2 [object] chore: commit all\n96dfa75 [object] implementation: add summary\n1235922 [object] TASK-4: light/dark spinner colours and offset below the status bar\n130686e [object] TASK-3: gate pull-to-refresh on what is under the finger in the page\nd3f14aa [object] TASK-2: wrap bridge WebView in SwipeRefreshLayout and reload on pull\n840523f [object] TASK-1: add androidx swiperefreshlayout 1.1.0 dependency\n56a9300 [object] chore: commit all\n70aa3e4 [object] chore: commit all\n* feature/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload\n+ main\n  remotes/origin/HEAD -> origin/main\n  remotes/origin/main","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018RaRXNrKoDnn98WKoLQj4C","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
