opens `/share`","+","+   Record the results in `implementation.md`."]}],"originalFile":"# Verdict: Swipe from top to reload\n\nid: object\nreviewer:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @reviewer and/or @security after implementation. -->\n\n## Review\n\n<!-- TASK-1: PASS / FAIL / PARTIAL\n     notes: ...\n\nTASK-2: ...\n-->\n\n## Security\n\n<!-- Any security findings from @security, or \"none\" if not run. -->\n\n## Overall\n\n<!-- APPROVED / REJECTED / NEEDS WORK -->\n<!-- Summary of what needs to change before this can be approved, if anything. -->\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YU14K2gZDeFstsg8qhcwMq","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
