been released to f-droid.\\nOne feedback: you cannot swipe down from the top to reload which is default behavior on most apps and necessary, e.g. if something didn't load properly or something was updated elsewhere.\\nPlease implement swipe from the top down to reload and show the kind of animated indicator you would expect from apps.\\n\\n## Why\\n\\n<!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\\n\\n## Out of scope\\n\\n<!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n<!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\\n\",\"numLines\":26,\"startLine\":1,\"totalLines\":26}},\"tool_result_meta\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01Ms8aGWnb7Q2VtLc8SaVQTY\",\"permission_decision\":{\"decision\":\"accept\",\"source\":\"config\",\"reason_type\":\"mode\"}}]}\n7:{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01A9YgjdzwDQ6yBiUvSpbwRY\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"docs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/tasks.md\\ndocs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/implementation.md\\ndocs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/verdict.md\\ndocs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/brief.md\\ndocs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/tokens.json\\ndocs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/session.log\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"1cb7cf17-d6d6-4b6e-8548-2d7e9a3a97c7\",\"uuid\":\"c8bd69f8-b776-4a9a-9b0c-dcdaa023f85f\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-14T14:35:25.395Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"filenames\":[\"docs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/tasks.md\",\"docs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/implementation.md\",\"docs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/verdict.md\",\"docs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/brief.md\",\"docs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/tokens.json\",\"docs/jobs/object_swipe-from-top-to-reload/session.log\"],\"durationMs\":8,\"numFiles\":6,\"truncated\":false,\"totalMatches\":6,\"countIsComplete\":true},\"tool_result_meta\"